===Pronoun===
'''kumpikin''' (''singular'')
# {{indefinite|lang=fi}} [[both|Both]].
#:'''''Kumpikin''' on punainen.''
#::'''''Both''' are red.''

====Inflection====
*The instructive plural is mainly used as an adverb.
