====Usage notes====
*Note: as seen in the example clause above, ''kumpikin'' is '''''singular''''', so, for the congruence, the verb must be conjugated in '''''singular'''''. ''Kumpikin'' has also plural forms, which are used e.g. in words that are used only in plural: '''kummatkin''' [[häät]], '''both''' the weddings.

